<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xml:lang="en" itunes:timing="Word"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Bullet In a Gun"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Imagine Dragons"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Origins (Deluxe Edition)"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1437948994"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><translations xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="L1">罗马之王 罗穆路斯</text><text for="L2">伫立险峰 生而求变</text><text for="L3">垂暮之日 终极评判</text><text for="L4">奥古斯都 尼禄 威慑天下</text><text for="L5">忽而意气风发 继而坠入低谷</text><text for="L6">戛然而止 旋即奋起前行</text><text for="L7">双极颠倒 难自控</text><text for="L8">方才笃定应承 瞬息断然否定</text><text for="L9">属于我的时代必将来临 我坚信不疑</text><text for="L10">扣紧扳机 蓄势待发</text><text for="L11">正如子弹已然上膛</text><text for="L12">但尘埃落定之时 我的巅峰必将来临</text><text for="L13">宛如离膛飞出的烈弹</text><text for="L14">倾尽血汗与泪 誓成独尊王者</text><text for="L15">枪膛烈弹 呼啸而出 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(嘿 嘿 嘿)</span></text><text for="L16">枪火连发 震颤长空 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(嘿 嘿 嘿 嘿)</span></text><text for="L17">子弹在膛 锋芒毕露 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(嘿 嘿 嘿)</span></text><text for="L18">雷霆轰鸣 连绵不绝 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(嘿 嘿 嘿 嘿)</span></text><text for="L19">膛中之弹 势不可挡</text><text for="L20">欲求扬名立万 必付沉重代价</text><text for="L21">押上毕生心血 别无他途</text><text for="L22">恶魔的契约 终将如期而至</text><text for="L23">欲戴王冠 唯有自微末拔地而起</text><text for="L24">情绪时而高涨 继而跌落深渊</text><text for="L25">步伐骤停 旋即又狂奔不止</text><text for="L26">双相狂澜 撕扯心神</text><text for="L27">刚刚点头首肯 转眼断然推拒</text><text for="L28">我的时代必定降临 我郑重立誓</text><text for="L29">击锤后扣 杀机暗涌</text><text for="L30">枪膛之弹 蓄势已久</text><text for="L31">可终局到来之时 终是属于我的荣光</text><text for="L32">宛若出膛重弹 锐不可当</text><text for="L33">洒尽心血泪汗 只为无可替代</text><text for="L34">膛内飞弹 破空呼啸 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(嘿 嘿 嘿)</span></text><text for="L35">火舌喷涌 轰然作响 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(嘿 嘿 嘿 嘿)</span></text><text for="L36">枪火连珠 势若奔雷 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(嘿 嘿 嘿)</span></text><text for="L37">烈焰狂响 破空震颤 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(嘿 嘿 嘿 嘿)</span></text><text for="L38">正如出膛烈火 势不可挡</text><text for="L39">几多微弱呼声 能被世人听闻</text><text for="L40">多少惨痛教训 始终未被汲取</text><text for="L41">多少行于艺途者 畏惧万众瞩目之光</text><text for="L42">畏惧锥心之痛 乃至陷入癫狂</text><text for="L43">丧失心智 迷失本真自我 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(你所贪图的 无非名与利)</span></text><text for="L44">变节之徒 沦为走狗 出卖初心</text><text for="L45">膛内重弹 蓄势待发 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(嘿)</span></text><text for="L46">可走到最后 我的时代终会破晓</text><text for="L47">势若雷霆 宛如出膛之弹</text><text for="L48">千锤百炼 倾尽血泪以成唯一</text><text for="L49">狂弹破膛 疾射呼啸 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(嘿 嘿 嘿)</span></text><text for="L50">烈火连发 响彻云霄 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(嘿 嘿 嘿 嘿)</span></text><text for="L51">炽热烈弹 破膛连发 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(嘿 嘿 嘿)</span></text><text for="L52">杀意炽盛 震耳欲聋 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(嘿 嘿 嘿 嘿)</span></text><text for="L53">正如膛中之—</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="3:18.790"><div begin="0:34.140" end="3:18.790"><p begin="0:34.140" end="0:37.120" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:34.140" end="0:34.330">The</span> <span begin="0:34.330" end="0:34.590">Ro</span><span begin="0:34.590" end="0:34.760">man</span> <span begin="0:34.760" end="0:35.280">king,</span> <span begin="0:35.950" end="0:36.110">the</span> <span begin="0:36.110" end="0:36.460">Ro</span><span begin="0:36.460" end="0:36.590">mu</span><span begin="0:36.590" end="0:37.120">lus</span></p><p begin="0:37.850" end="0:41.510" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:37.850" end="0:37.980">The</span> <span begin="0:37.980" end="0:39.040">precipice,</span> <span begin="0:39.830" end="0:40.190">born</span> <span begin="0:40.190" end="0:40.270">to</span> <span begin="0:40.270" end="0:41.510">change</span></p><p begin="0:41.510" end="0:44.610" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:41.510" end="0:41.590">The</span> <span begin="0:41.590" end="0:42.000">fi</span><span begin="0:42.000" end="0:42.120">nal</span> <span begin="0:42.120" end="0:42.850">days,</span> <span begin="0:43.390" end="0:43.510">the</span> <span begin="0:43.510" end="0:43.880">last</span> <span begin="0:43.880" end="0:44.090">ap</span><span begin="0:44.090" end="0:44.610">praise</span></p><p begin="0:45.420" end="0:48.290" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:45.420" end="0:45.430">Au</span><span begin="0:45.430" end="0:45.860">gus</span><span begin="0:45.860" end="0:46.220">tus,</span> <span begin="0:46.330" end="0:47.070">Nero,</span> <span begin="0:47.230" end="0:47.460">tak</span><span begin="0:47.460" end="0:47.700">ing</span> <span begin="0:47.700" end="0:48.290">names</span></p><p begin="0:48.950" end="0:50.780" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:48.950" end="0:49.110">I'm</span> <span begin="0:49.110" end="0:49.570">high,</span> <span begin="0:49.570" end="0:49.850">then</span> <span begin="0:49.850" end="0:50.040">I'm</span> <span begin="0:50.040" end="0:50.340">low,</span> <span begin="0:50.520" end="0:50.780">low</span></p><p begin="0:50.900" end="0:52.620" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:50.900" end="0:51.460">Stop,</span> <span begin="0:51.460" end="0:51.700">then</span> <span begin="0:51.700" end="0:51.850">I</span> <span begin="0:51.850" end="0:52.170">go,</span> <span begin="0:52.380" end="0:52.620">go</span></p><p begin="0:52.820" end="0:54.500" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:52.820" end="0:53.810">Bipolar,</span> <span begin="0:53.810" end="0:54.040">oh,</span> <span begin="0:54.270" end="0:54.500">oh</span></p><p begin="0:54.650" end="0:56.260" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:54.650" end="0:55.110">Yes,</span> <span begin="0:55.110" end="0:55.380">then</span> <span begin="0:55.380" end="0:55.560">I'm</span> <span begin="0:55.560" end="0:55.860">no,</span> <span begin="0:56.050" end="0:56.260">no</span></p><p begin="0:56.270" end="0:59.330" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:56.270" end="0:56.460">My</span> <span begin="0:56.460" end="0:56.800">time</span> <span begin="0:56.800" end="0:56.900">will</span> <span begin="0:56.900" end="0:57.490">come,</span> <span begin="0:58.160" end="0:58.250">I</span> <span begin="0:58.250" end="0:58.610">prom</span><span begin="0:58.610" end="0:58.820">ise</span> <span begin="0:58.820" end="0:59.330">that</span></p><p begin="0:59.700" end="1:01.530" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:59.700" end="0:59.990">Pull</span> <span begin="0:59.990" end="1:00.120">the</span> <span begin="1:00.120" end="1:00.420">trig</span><span begin="1:00.420" end="1:00.570">ger</span> <span begin="1:00.570" end="1:01.120">back,</span> <span begin="1:01.120" end="1:01.530">back</span></p><p